<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps - About</title>
  <%- include("includes/head") %>
  <% if (!testSite) { %>
<meta name="description" content="About Boise Gems Drum & Bugle Corps, program information, and staff.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://boisegems.org/boise-gems-corps-about">
<% } %>


  <!-- styles moved to styles.css -->
</head>
<body class="about-page" style="background:#fafafa;">
<header><%- include("includes/header") %></header>

<section class="about-hero hero-corps">
  <div class="about-hero__content">
    <div class="about-hero__card">
    <h1 class="about-hero__title">Boise Gems Drum &amp; Bugle Corps</h1>
    <p class="about-hero__text">A youth-focused marching arts experience built on excellence, education, and community impact.</p>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-section">
  <div class="about-wrap about-prose">
    <h2>Corps Program</h2>
    <p>The Boise Gems Drum and Bugle Corps provides a high-level educational and performance environment for members seeking growth in music, movement, and leadership. We focus on improving musicianship, fostering teamwork, and developing skills that will benefit members both on and off the field.</p>
    <p>With there being no corps in Idaho prior to our founding, we knew we had the opportunity to create something truly special for the local community and aspiring performers.</p>
    <p>We choose the best of the best for staff and design, ensuring that we can provide an exceptional experience for our members.</p>
    <br>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;">
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="/img/ui/openclass.png" alt="Openclass logo" style="min-width: 20%; max-width: 200px;">
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>As of 2026, we are a DCI Open Class corps, a milestone for the corps and for the state of Idaho. It's our hope to continue to grow and develop as a corps, and to provide meaningful experiences for our members and the community.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <br>
  
</section>

<section class="about-section">
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <h2>Shows</h2>
  </div>
</section>



<a href="/shows/2026-the-color-of-chaos" class="no-decor">
  <div class="video-wrapper" style="background-color: #0a0000;">
    <video playsinline autoplay muted loop style="filter: brightness(0.7);">
      <source src="/vid/2026.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>

    <div class="video-header" style="position: relative; z-index: 301;">
      <h1 style="color: #fff; font-size: 3rem; text-decoration: none;">2026</h1>
      <img src="/img/shows/2026/wordmark.png" alt="The Color of Chaos logo" style="max-width: 540px; width: 80%; filter: invert(1);">
    </div>
  </div>
</a>

<a href="/shows/2025-the-animated" class="no-decor">
  <div class="video-wrapper">
    <video playsinline autoplay muted loop style="filter: brightness(0.7);">
      <source src="/vid/2025.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>

    <div class="video-header">
      <h1 style="color: var(--light-half); font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 1rem); text-decoration: none;">2025</h1>
      <img src="/img/shows/2025/animatedtitle.png" alt="Ghost Stallion logo" style="max-width: 80%;">
    </div>
  </div>
</a>

<a href="/shows/2024-ghost-stallion" class="no-decor">
  <div class="video-wrapper">
    <video playsinline autoplay muted loop style="filter: brightness(0.7);">
      <source src="/vid/2024.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>

    <div class="video-header">
      <h1 style="color: var(--light-half); font-size: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 3rem); text-decoration: none;">2024</h1>
      <img src="/img/shows/2024/ghosttitle.png" alt="Ghost Stallion logo" style="max-width: 80%;">
    </div>
  </div>
</a>

<a href="/shows/2023-esto-perpetua" class="no-decor">
  <div class="video-wrapper">
    <video playsinline autoplay muted loop style="filter: brightness(0.7);">
      <source src="/vid/2023.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      Your browser does not support the video tag.
    </video>

    <div class="video-header">
      <h1 style="color: var(--light-half); font-size: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 3rem); text-decoration: none;">2023</h1>
      <h1 style="color: var(--light-half); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; text-shadow: 0px 0px 8px #fff;">Esto Perpetua</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
</a>

<section class="about-section about-section--staff">
  <div class="about-wrap">
    <h2>Staff</h2>
    <%- include("includes/staff-gem-wall", { staffSections: staffSections }) %>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const videos = document.querySelectorAll('.video-wrapper video')
  const isMobile = /iPhone|iPad|iPod|Android/i.test(navigator.userAgent)

  if (isMobile) {
    videos.forEach(v => { v.play(), v.style.filter = "brightness(1)" })
  } else {
    videos.forEach(v => {
      v.pause()
      const parent = v.parentElement
      parent.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { v.play(), v.style.filter = "brightness(1)" })
      parent.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { v.pause(), v.style.filter = "brightness(0.7)" })
    })
  }
</script>

<footer><%- include("includes/footer") %></footer>
</body>
</html>
